  "Id": "27c6aa52-7b3e-4a9a-b6e5-0359f7155cee"/*ChainLinkSDF*/,
  "Description": "Generates a single chain link as an SDF.\n\nRender the result with [RaymarchField] and inspect it with [VisualizeFieldDistance]. Modify it with [TransformField], [BendField], [RepeatPolar] and other field operators. Use [RepeatFieldLimit] together with [RotateAxis] to build a chain.\n\nSee also: [TorusSDF], [CapsuleLineSDF]",
